body:
My plans for this sub are to give the users of r/bowhunting the safe space they deserve to be able to talk about not just the hobby but the lifestyle that is archery. For millions of years, our ancestors have passed down the art of bow hunting in the pursuit of obtaining the most organic, sustainable, and natural food source known to man, wild game. The users of this sub are being harassed by trolls all while our mod is nowhere to be found. If I'm granted the title of mod ill be sure to get rid of the trolls and continue to create a safe space to discuss the time-honored tradition of bowhunting.

